msgid "2 hours"
msgstr "2 часа"

#: settings-qt/bridge/backend.py:3617
msgid "2 minutes"
msgstr "2 минуты"

#: settings-qt/qml/pages/FlowPage.qml:492
msgid "2. Keep both computers on the same network."
msgstr "2. Подключите оба компьютера к одной сети."

#: settings-qt/qml/pages/FlowPage.qml:493
msgid ""
"3. Install and open JuhFlow on the Mac. It finds this computer by itself."
msgstr ""
"3. Установите и откройте JuhFlow на Mac. Приложение само найдёт этот "
"компьютер."

